    "created_at": "2016-01-20T15:54:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-20T15:54:09Z",
    "body": "I believe the following works:\n\n``` html\n<base href=\"invalid-url\">\n<a href=\"relative-url.html\">\n```\n\nurl will be null. Calling `a.hash = \"foo\"` should terminate.\n\nNow, do `document.querySelector(\"base\").href = \"http://example.com/\"`. url is still null.\n\nAt this point calling `a.hash = \"foo\"` should work: parsing \"relative-url.html\" against \"http://example.com/\" should work. But in the current spec it does not, since url is null, and stays null forever.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
